The TPD4E02B04DQA symbol in Iasis.kicad_sym uses the drawing and pin placement
of the KiCad community's Power_Protection:TPD4EUSB30 symbol. Its part metadata
is for TI TPD4E02B04DQAR; the DQA package has the same protected-pad, ground
and flow-through-pad numbering.
